[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0000","text":"推文投稿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0010","text":"……呼\n今天也努力了，千雪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0020","text":"（『＃温柔强化月』，现在怎么样了呢……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0030","text":"！这是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0040","text":"……早上好\n甘奈，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0050","text":"……\n啊……千雪……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0070","text":"……是在看推文吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0080","text":"……嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0090","text":"那、那个……\n千雪也……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0100","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0110","text":"这是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0120","text":"『对谁都无法感谢的我\n　是不是个没用的人……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0130","text":"『＃温柔强化月』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0140","text":"『看到最近ALSTROEMERIA用的那个标签\n　心里有点不是滋味』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0150","text":"『我知道她们应该没有那个意思\n　但还是忍不住这么想』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0160","text":"『看到她们只感谢不认识的人\n　就会觉得是不是不感谢粉丝啊』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0170","text":"『＃温柔强化月』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0180","text":"『我悟到我的温柔永远无法传达到甜花那里\n　默默湿了枕头』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0190","text":"『＃温柔强化月』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01040100_04_0200","text":"…………"}]
